<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to CareMatch AI – Your SNF partner account</title>
    <!--[if mso]>
    <noscript>
      <xml>
        <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
          <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
        </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
      </xml>
    </noscript>
    <![endif]-->
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100vw;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        font-family: 'Rethink Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #212B36;
        background-color: #F4F6F8;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      }
      .preheader {
        display: none;
        max-height: 0;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .email-root {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        background-color: #F4F6F8;
        padding: 40px 24px;
      }
      .container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .card {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        background-color: #FFFFFF;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      }
      .brand {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #00B8D9;
        padding: 32px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .brand-name {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: #FFFFFF;
      }
      .brand-sub {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }
      .main {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 24px 32px;
      }
      .greeting {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #212B36;
      }
      .intro {
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #212B36;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }
      .highlight {
        margin: 0 0 24px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        background-color: #E6F9FC;
        border: 1px solid #B6EBF5;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #0E7490;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }
      .section-title {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #637381;
      }
      .credentials {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #F8FAFC;
        border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 16px 18px;
        margin: 0 0 28px;
      }
      .credentials p {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #212B36;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .credentials p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .credentials strong {
        color: #637381;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .cta-wrap {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
      }
      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #00B8D9;
        color: #FFFFFF !important;
        padding: 14px 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-family: inherit;
      }
      .button-secondary {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #161C24;
        color: #FFFFFF !important;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-family: inherit;
      }
      .cta-note {
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #637381;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .steps {
        margin: 0 0 28px;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
      }
      .steps li {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        padding-left: 28px;
        position: relative;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #212B36;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .steps li:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
      .steps li::before {
        content: attr(data-step);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        top: 0;
        width: 20px;
        height: 20px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #00B8D9;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background-color: #DFE3E8;
        margin: 8px 0 24px;
      }
      .link-fallback {
        margin: 0 0 8px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #637381;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .link {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
        word-break: break-all;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #00B8D9;
      }
      .disclaimer {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #637381;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .sign-off {
        margin: 24px 0 0;
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #212B36;
      }
      .footer-wrap {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 28px 24px 36px;
        border-top: 1px solid #DFE3E8;
      }
      .footer-text {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #919EAB;
        line-height: 1.5;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <span class="preheader">
      Welcome to CareMatch AI. Log in to refer patients and manage your skilled nursing partner account.
    </span>
    <div class="email-root">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="brand">
            <h1 class="brand-name">CareMatch AI</h1>
            <p class="brand-sub">Skilled Nursing Partner Invitation</p>
          </div>
          <div class="main">
            <p class="greeting">Hello <%= user.name %>,</p>
            <p class="intro">
              Welcome to CareMatch AI where you can refer patients to find an assisted living
              facility. Log in below to your account using our temporary password or you can reset
              your password first. In your profile you can manage your listing, view who has
              scanned your referral code and reply to messages from your facility dashboard.
            </p>

            <div class="highlight">
              Your account is ready. Sign in with the details below, or reset your password first to secure your access.
            </div>

            <p class="section-title">Your login details</p>
            <div class="credentials">
              <p><strong>Email / Username:</strong> <%= username %></p>
              <p><strong>Temporary password:</strong> <%= temporaryPassword %></p>
            </div>

            <p class="section-title">Get started</p>
            <ul class="steps">
              <li data-step="1">Click <strong>Sign In</strong> below to open CareMatch AI</li>
              <li data-step="2">Sign in with your email and temporary password</li>
              <li data-step="3">Set a new password, then manage your SNF profile and referral QR</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="cta-wrap">
              <a class="button" href="<%= loginUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Sign In to Your Account
              </a>
            </div>
            <p class="cta-note">
              Prefer to set your password first?
            </p>
            <div class="cta-wrap">
              <a class="button-secondary" href="<%= resetLink %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Set Your Password
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="link-fallback">
              If the Sign In button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
            </p>
            <p class="link"><%= loginUrl %></p>

            <p class="link-fallback">
              Password reset link:
            </p>
            <p class="link"><%= resetLink %></p>

            <p class="disclaimer">
              This invitation was sent because an administrator added your skilled nursing facility to CareMatch AI.
              If you were not expecting this email, you can ignore it or contact support.
            </p>
            <p class="sign-off">
              Best regards,<br />
              The CareMatch AI Team
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-wrap">
            <p class="footer-text">
              CareMatch AI – Connecting families with trusted care communities.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
